{"server":"tw","storyId":"main_8_level_main_08-10_end","groupId":"main_8","stageId":"main_08-10","title":"相逢，總是離別","storyCode":"R8-9","avgTag":"行動後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_08-10_end.txt","sourceHash":"5bb6412598a1e5969c082eacbbee6ab378c429ee09cb86a6ddd1ddd2c0be1770","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_snowconutry_1"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"你們居然連援軍也一併打垮了？不愧是塔露拉......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"感染者同胞們呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"已經安頓好了。我們找的那個備用據點有用了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"清點過人數沒有？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"清點過了，有幾個孩子哭著說什麼姐姐沒回來之類的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"不過這種事甚至有些常見了。哎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"塔露拉！殘存的糾察隊我們已經發現了。看來是一直在逃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"逃向哪裡去了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"東邊。不知道他們會不會找到之前我們趕走的那幾個人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"——塔露拉？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"等，等等！塔露拉，你去哪？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"奔跑。\n奔跑。\n長靴被冰水浸透。\n腿腳深陷進反射著刺眼光芒的雪地。\n忘記用雪橇。\n忘記騎上雪地車。\n將雪全都融化。\n在泥濘中奔跑。\n不知走了多久。\n不知跑了多久。\n寒風鑽入肺部。\n痛覺刺進大腦。\n奔跑。奔跑。\n雪為什麼還沒有盡頭。\n冬天為什麼還沒有盡頭。\n大地為什麼還沒有盡頭。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_iceforest_1"},{"type":"narration","text":"滴答。\n塔露拉停下了腳步。\n滴答。\n淚水正自她的眼角墜下。\n即使現在的她還沒意識到自己身上發生了什麼。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"阿麗娜就那樣倒在路旁。\n她緊攥著手中的空籃，鮮血浸濕了她的衣裳。\n將她身旁深掩住草木與泥土的慘白也一同染成了暗淡紅色。\n雪就這麼下著。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_iceforest_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"阿......阿......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿麗娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_079","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿麗娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_079","isRemote":false,"text":"塔露......拉？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"阿麗娜......！！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿麗娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_079","isRemote":false,"text":"真不想......讓你看到我這樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"別說話！阿麗娜，別說話......別說話！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"我幫你止血......！我幫你......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿麗娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_079","isRemote":false,"text":"已經......沒有再流血了......只是....."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"那我們走......我們走！叫醫護兵給你輸血！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿麗娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_079","isRemote":false,"text":"沒關係......不過......換來的東西被......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"別管了......別管了......我帶你走......帶你走！！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"德拉克背起了埃拉菲亞。只有這時候，她才驚覺，這隻輕盈的小鹿，竟然這麼重，這麼重......簡直就像是這片大地。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿麗娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_079","isRemote":false,"text":"不用再......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"不可能！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"誰幹的......誰幹的......誰幹的？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"是糾察隊......？！是那些村民？！那些混蛋......那些混蛋......我要燒死他們......我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，難道是......那些被趕走的感染者......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"這些忘恩負義的......不，不，如果盾衛肯分給他們口糧......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿麗娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"塔露拉......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊......我在聽......我在聽！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿麗娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我不會告訴你......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼？！為什麼？！！我難道連為你報仇都做不到嗎！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿麗娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不准......你自己說的怎麼能忘記？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿麗娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你怎麼能為了報仇去戰鬥？你已經選了，塔露拉，你已經選了一條路......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿麗娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"為我......半途而廢......？我不接受......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿麗娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不准......去恨誰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你說什麼，你說什麼！我怎麼做得到......怎麼做得到！！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿麗娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你自己說過......！你不能去恨任何人......！否則你就會被......那個詛咒你的老人......吞噬......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿麗娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......哪怕那個法術從來都不存在，你不也是會......被他代表的那些東西......操控？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿麗娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這是你自己說的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"對......對。可是......可是......那些人......那些......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿麗娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......你也知道他們都從哪裡來，又是......為什麼這麼做。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿麗娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你自己也說過......你面對的不是這些......敵人......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"別說了......阿麗娜......別說了......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿麗娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不......塔露拉......你......說的我都記住......所以你也......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿麗娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你要打碎的......不是這些人......是把他們逼成這樣，造成這樣的......烏薩斯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿麗娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這樣的烏薩斯......這樣的......大地......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"可以了......可以了，阿麗娜......可以了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿麗娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"只有你，塔露拉......你可以厭惡一件事......他們做的事情，你可以痛恨......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿麗娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"可你不准去恨......一個人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿麗娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你看我說的......對嗎？我們活得......有意義嗎？嘶，嗚......我不知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿麗娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我不知道我們是不是做錯了......我只是很清楚那個詛咒......是什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿麗娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你的憤怒......可以燒遍荒野......但你不可以去恨......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿麗娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"阿麗娜......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿麗娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我好擔心。塔露拉，我好擔心。如果我不在了，你一定要讓葉蓮娜提醒你......這些都是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"阿麗娜，別再說了！我的身邊......我不希望身邊沒有你，沒有葉蓮娜，沒有薩沙伊諾，你們每一個我都不能......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我不想失去你們任何一個......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿麗娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊，塔露拉......可是我們所有人......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿麗娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"相逢就是......為了別離。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"白髮的德拉克跋涉在無垠雪地。埃拉菲亞女孩靠在她背上不住地顫抖，時而深深抽氣。\n雪花自埃拉菲亞的角上滑落。冰雪覆蓋的樹木在塔露拉走過後無聲燃燒，她無意識地點燃了她踏足的土地。\n只有她面前的雪原是無盡的。只有她脊背上的阿麗娜是溫暖的。\n心臟的跳動聲自塔露拉的脊背傳進她心裡，越來越輕。\n她想尖叫。她想痛哭。她想把所有的感覺從肺裡擠出來，好像那樣就能把已經發生了的一切從身體裡抹去。\n塔露拉沒能發出一點聲音。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿麗娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"塔露拉......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我們快到了，阿麗娜.....我們就快到了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不要閉眼......不要閉上眼！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿麗娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"太遠了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿麗娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不用......騙我。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"雪越下越大。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿麗娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"塔露......拉......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我聽著呢，阿麗娜。你說。你說。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿麗娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......雪......比我想的......要暖。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿麗娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不好意思......我還沒能把我們說的那些......都寫下來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不要緊的。不要緊的，阿麗娜。都不要緊的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿麗娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那幾個孩子......尤其是......伊諾......你要......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我在聽，我在聽！阿麗娜......我在聽！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿麗娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"光是......和他說是......沒有......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿麗娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"好熱......塔露拉......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿麗娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......我不想死......我還沒......你的妹妹......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿麗娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"塔露拉......一定要......活......下......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"這樣就好。\n塔露拉不記得之後發生了什麼。\n塔露拉什麼都不記得。\n塔露拉本該記得的一切，都隨著雪花一起融化。\n她留下了一條火徑，她背後的一切，除了阿麗娜，都在烈火中消失殆盡。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"鋪天漫地的大雪裡，塔露拉走向了她與友人的別離。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_snowconutry_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小隊成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"塔露拉！你終於回來了，通訊你也不接，怎麼回——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小隊成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"......這......你背著的那是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小隊成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，她已經沒氣了！醫護兵！快來再檢查一下！塔露拉，你等下......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小隊成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"......塔露拉？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小隊成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"（哎，她怎麼只是一個勁地往前走......她去哪？！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"塔露拉，即使是作為領頭人，你私自離隊也是嚴重——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"等等。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"葉蓮娜......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"讓她去吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"（你認識那個可憐的姑娘嗎......？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"（不太認識。似乎......是聚落裡的一個老師。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"（啊，老師。孩子們又失去了一個好人。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"（可塔露拉為什麼......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"（......所有人都有些各自保留的事情......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"（這事情也許只屬於她。）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"在眾人的目視下，德拉克背著埃拉菲亞走過駐地，她們的身影慢慢地不再分明，逐漸隱沒在森林邊緣。\n沒人知道後來發生了什麼。\n他們只是看著，看著塔露拉步入黑夜。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","aliases":["霜星"]}]}
